00:06:43.569 --> 00:06:47.410
Now, when we look at our world details here

152
00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.410
let's go to our world settings.

153
00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:52.329
You'll notice as I scroll down a bit

154
00:06:52.329 --> 00:06:54.970
that we are using HLODs for our environment.

155
00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.449
Here's a default HLOD layer.

156
00:06:57.449 --> 00:06:59.769
Now it's up to you if you build these

